            </note>
            <note corresp="#d45-f3" n="3" xml:id="d45-f3-content">
                <p>Reference is to telegram 43803 to USUN,
                    February 22. (National Archives, RG 59, Central Foreign Policy File,
                    D790082–0993) For a description of the Security Council meetings February 23–28,
                    see <hi rendition="#italic">Yearbook of the United Nations, 1979</hi>, pp.
                    281–283.</p>
            </note>
